==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|sh|ota||tr=talaz|notext=1}}, from {{etyl|grc|sh}} {{m|grc|θάλασσα||sea}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/tâlaːs/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|та|лас|lang=sh}}

===Noun===
{{sh-noun|g=m|head=та̏ла̄с}}

